<refentry id="SQL-ALTERCONVERSION">
 <refmeta>
  <refentrytitle id="SQL-ALTERCONVERSION-TITLE">ALTER CONVERSION</refentrytitle>
  <refmiscinfo>SQL - 语言语句</refmiscinfo>
 </refmeta>

 <refnamediv>
  <refname>ALTER CONVERSION</refname>
  <refpurpose>更改一个转换的定义</refpurpose>
 </refnamediv>  
  
 <indexterm zone="sql-alterconversion">
  <primary>ALTER CONVERSION</primary>
 </indexterm>

 <refsynopsisdiv>
<synopsis>
ALTER CONVERSION <replaceable>name</replaceable> RENAME TO <replaceable>newname</replaceable>
</synopsis>
 </refsynopsisdiv>
  
 <refsect1>
  <title>描述</title>

  <para>
   <command>ALTER CONVERSION</command> 更改一个转换的定义。目前唯一可用的功能是重命名转换。
  </para>
 </refsect1>
  
 <refsect1>
  <title>参数</title>

  <variablelist>
   <varlistentry>
    <term><replaceable class="parameter">name</replaceable></term>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      一个现有转换的名称（可以是模式限定的）。
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>

   <varlistentry>
    <term><replaceable class="parameter">newname</replaceable></term>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      转换的新名称。
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>

  </variablelist>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>示例</title>

  <para>
   要把转换 <literal>iso_8859_1_to_utf_8</literal> 重命名为
   <literal>latin1_to_unicode</literal>：
<programlisting>
ALTER CONVERSION iso_8859_1_to_utf_8 RENAME TO latin1_to_unicode;
</programlisting>
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>兼容性</title>

  <para>
   在 SQL 标准中没有<command>ALTER CONVERSION</command>语句。
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>另见</title>

  <simplelist type="inline">
   <member><xref linkend="sql-createconversion" endterm="sql-createconversion-title"></member>
   <member><xref linkend="sql-dropconversion" endterm="sql-dropconversion-title"></member>
  </simplelist>
 </refsect1>
</refentry>

